                <pb facs="0597" n="485" xml:id="pg485"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Minister Sherrill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-07-14"><hi rendition="#italic">July 14,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>For your information and repetition to the embassy at Petropolis, I quote the
                    following telegram sent yesterday to the legation at Quito: [See quoted portion
                    of telegram of July 13 to Minister Fox.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
